12. (j) a director of a holding company of the licensed bank and its subsidiaries;
13. (k) a close relation of a person specified in Order 1.1 (e) and (f) above;
14. (l) a concern, whose director or partner is a director of such bank;
15. (m) a concern in which a material shareholder of a licensed bank has substantial interest; and
16. (n) a concern in which a close relation of an individual material shareholder has a substantial interest.
17. 2.1 The central bank of sri Lanka has approved the following limits in respect of accommodation granted by licensed banks to related parties of such banks, subject to obtaining approved securities specified in the banking act determination No. 04 of 2024 dated 01.10.2024 on 'approved securities for accommodation Granted to related Parties of Licensed banks':
18. (a) In the case of accommodation granted to related parties that are individuals as specified in (a), (b), (e), (f), (i), (j) and (k) of Order 1.1 above; up to rupees Twenty Million (rs. 20,000,000/-).
19. (b) In the case of accommodation granted to related parties that are concerns as specified in (c), (d), (f), (g), (h), (m) and (n) of Order 1.1 above; 10% of the Tier 1 capital of the licensed bank.
20. (c) In the case of accommodation granted to related parties that are concerns as specified in (l) of Order 1.1 above; 15% of the Tier 1 capital of the licensed bank.

2. Approved limits in respect of accommodation granted to Related Parties
2. 1.1 The following categories of persons shall be considered as 'related parties' of licensed banks for the purpose of this Order:
3. (a) a director of a licensed bank;
4. (b) close relations of such director;
5. (c) a concern in which a director of a licensed bank has a substantial interest, being an interest acquired either before or after the appointment as a director of such licensed bank;
6. (d) a concern in which a close relation of a director of a licensed bank has a substantial interest;
7. (e) a chief executive officer or an officer performing executive functions of a licensed bank in respect of any accommodation granted other than an accommodation granted to such officer under a scheme applicable to the employees of such bank;
8. (f) a shareholder of a licensed bank having material interest, whether individual or a concern;
9. (g) a subsidiary or an associate company of the licensed bank;
10. (h) a holding company of the licensed bank including its subsidiaries, excluding the parent bank and subsidiaries of a bank incorporated outside sri Lanka;
11. (i) a director of a subsidiary or an associate company of the licensed bank;
12. (j) a director of a holding company of the licensed bank and its subsidiaries;
13. (k) a close relation of a person specified in Order 1.1 (e) and (f) above;
14. (l) a concern, whose director or partner is a director of such bank;
15. (m) a concern in which a material shareholder of a licensed bank has substantial interest; and
16. (n) a concern in which a close relation of an individual material shareholder has a substantial interest.

